F.CPU.cache | Cache & memory-access optimization | cpu-performance E \n801\t    PRF.CPU.simd | Vectorization audits | cpu-performance E ['math-simd-numerics']\n802\t    PRF.CPU.contention | Contention & false-sharing analysis | cpu-performance E ['concurrency-primitives']\n803\t    PRF.CPU.hybrid | Hybrid-core & power-aware tuning | cpu-performance E ['job-system-task-graph']\n804\t    PRF.CPU.compiler | PGO / LTO & compiler optimization | cpu-performance E ['build-system-toolchains']\n805\t -- PRF.GPU GPU performance\n806\t    PRF.GPU.analysis | Occupancy, bandwidth & cache analysis | gpu-performance E \n807\t    PRF.GPU.overlap | Barrier & async-overlap tuning | gpu-performance E ['render-graph-scheduling']\n808\t    PRF.GPU.tools | Vendor tool expertise across PC, console & mobile | gpu-performance E \n809\t    PRF.GPU.power | GPU power & thermal | gpu-performance E ['platform-mobile-portable']\n810\t -- PRF.LOAD Loading & hitches\n811\t    PRF.LOAD.load-time | Load-time optimization | loading-streaming-performance E \n812\t    PRF.LOAD.hitches | Hitch & stutter elimination (PSO, streaming, GC) | loading-streaming-performance E \n813\t    PRF.LOAD.io | IO throughput analysis | loading-streaming-performance E ['async-io-storage']\n814\t    PRF.LOAD.startup | Startup time | loading-streaming-performance E \n815\t== OBS Observability & diagnostics\n816\t -- OBS.LOG Instrumentation\n817\t    OBS.LOG.logging | Structured logging | observability-telemetry E \n818\t    OBS.LOG.tracing | Trace instrumentation (CPU, GPU, IO, memory zones) | observability-telemetry E \n819\t    OBS.LOG.profilers | Profiler integrations (Tracy, Perfetto, PIX, Superluminal class) | observability-telemetry E \n820\t    OBS.LOG.metrics | Metrics & counters | observability-telemetry E \n821\t    OBS.LOG.stats | In-game stats overlays | observability-telemetry E ['visual-debugging-tools']\n822\t    OBS.LOG.telemetry | Development & live telemetry pipeline | observability-telemetry E \n823\t    OBS.LOG.consent | Telemetry privacy & consent | observability-telemetry E ['security-engineering']\n824\t    OBS.LOG.remote | Remote diagnostics to devices | observability-telemetry E \n825\t -- OBS.CRASH Crash & hang diagnostics\n826\t    OBS.CRASH.capture | Crash capture & minidumps | crash-diagnostics E \n827\t    OBS.CRASH.pipeline | Crash reporting, bucketing & triage | crash-diagnostics E \n828\t    OBS.CRASH.symbolication | Symbolication | crash-diagnostics E ['ci-cd-automation']\n829\t    OBS.CRASH.gpu | GPU crash dumps | crash-diagnostics E ['rhi-core']\n830\t    OBS.CRASH.hangs | Hang & watchdog detection | crash-diagnostics E \n831\t    OBS.CRASH.oom | OOM diagnostics | crash-diagnostics E ['memory-allocators']\n832\t    OBS.CRASH.asserts | Assert & ensure reporting | crash-diagnostics E \n833\t== XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines\n834\t -- XC.DET Determinism & replay\n835\t    XC.DET.levels | Determinism levels & per-subsystem contract | determinism-replay E \n836\t    XC.DET.float | Floating-point determinism policy (flags, FMA, transcendentals) | determinism-replay E ['math-simd-numerics']\n837\t    XC.DET.parallel | Deterministic parallel execution (ordered reductions) | determinism-replay E ['job-system-task-graph']\n838\t    XC.DET.replay | Input & state record/replay for debugging | determinism-replay E \n839\t    XC.DET.desync | Desync detection & state hashing | determinism-replay E \n840\t    XC.DET.compat | Replay compatibility across builds | determinism-replay E ['api-lifecycle-migration']\n841\t -- XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration\n842\t    XC.ITER.protocol | Reload protocol & state preservation | hot-reload-iteration E \n843\t    XC.ITER.live-coding | C++ live coding | hot-reload-iteration E \n844\t    XC.ITER.coordination | Asset, shader, script & config reload coordination | hot-reload-iteration E \n845\t    XC.ITER.metrics | Iteration-time metrics (edit → see latency) | hot-reload-iteration E ['developer-experience-docs']\n846\t -- XC.SEC Security\n847\t    XC.SEC.threats | Threat modeling | security-engineering E \n848\t    XC.SEC.coding | Secure coding & memory-safety policy | security-engineering E \n849\t    XC.SEC.trust | Trust boundaries for untrusted input | security-engineering E \n850\t    XC.SEC.supply-chain | Supply-chain security (SBOM, signing, reproducible builds) | security-engineering E ['build-system-toolchains']\n851\t    XC.SEC.secrets | Secrets management | security-engineering E ['ci-cd-automation']\n852\t    XC.SEC.tamper | Anti-tamper & DRM boundary | security-engineering E \n853\t    XC.SEC.privacy | Privacy engineering | security-engineering E \n854\t    XC.SEC.sandbox | Mod / UGC sandbox policy | security-engineering E ['modding-ugc']\n855\t    XC.SEC.server-validation | Server-side cheat validation | anti-cheat-integrity E \n856\t    XC.SEC.anticheat | Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary | anti-cheat-integrity E \n857\t    XC.SEC.abuse | Exploit & economy-abuse detection signals | anti-cheat-integrity E ['platform-online-services']\n858\t -- XC.EXT Extensibility & evolution\n859\t    XC.EXT.api-surface | Public API surface definition | api-lifecycle-migration E \n860\t    XC.EXT.versioning | Semantic versioning & deprecation policy | api-lifecycle-migration E \n861\t    XC.EXT.abi | ABI policy for binary plugins | api-lifecycle-migration E ['plugin-system']\n862\t    XC.EXT.upgrade | Engine upgrade tooling (codemods, data upgraders) | api-lifecycle-migration E ['serialization-schema']\n863\t    XC.EXT.lts | LTS & support policy | api-lifecycle-migration E ['build-release-architect']\n864\t    XC.EXT.plugins | Plugin architecture & discovery | plugin-system E \n865\t    XC.EXT.plugin-deps | Plugin packaging & dependency resolution | plugin-system E \n866\t    XC.EXT.mod-sdk | Mod SDK & tooling | modding-ugc E \n867\t    XC.EXT.mod-loading | Mod loading & override precedence | modding-ugc E ['package-formats-vfs']\n868\t    XC.EXT.ugc | UGC pipeline | modding-ugc E ['platform-online-services']\n869\t    XC.EXT.mod-compat | Mod compatibility across patches | modding-ugc E ['api-lifecycle-migration']\n870\t -- XC.DX Documentation & developer experience\n871\t    XC.DX.api-docs | API reference generation | developer-experience-docs E \n872\t    XC.DX.arch-docs | Architecture & subsystem documentation | developer-experience-docs E ['engine-architect']\n873\t    XC.DX.samples | Sample-project ladder (2D → open-world online) doubling as integration tests | developer-experience-docs E \n874\t    XC.DX.templates | Project templates & creation | developer-experience-docs E \n875\t    XC.DX.onboarding | Onboarding paths | developer-experience-docs E \n876\t    XC.DX.doc-tests | Documentation testing (snippets compile and run) | developer-experience-docs E ['test-architect']\n877\t    XC.DX.errors | Error-message & diagnostic quality standards | developer-experience-docs E \n878\t"}]},"uuid":"07d7b303-1e05-4fbd-96a0-6e19d185dccb","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:46:43.048Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"faba2dee-8641-44f7-ac28-8e9fbe8b4109","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
